.TH pw 1 "portwright" "" "Portwright"
.SH NAME
pw \- short alias for portwright, the Portwright USB\-C dongle CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdg\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBdg\fR is a symlink to \fBportwright\fR installed by this package: every command, flag and
subcommand is identical.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBportwright\fR(1) and its subcommand pages (\fBportwright\-device\fR(1), \fBportwright\-power\fR(1), ...)
for the full command tree.
